This licence covers the code in code/, reddit/collage.py and the page scripts.

Data files in data/ with record counts (counties.csv, signature_species.csv,
only_here.csv, newcomers.csv, page.json, species_vc.json, results.json) are
derived from NBN Atlas records published under CC0, CC BY 4.0 or the Open
Government Licence v3.0 and are released under CC BY 4.0; attribute the NBN
Atlas (https://nbnatlas.org) and its data providers.
data/vice_counties.geojson is simplified from the Biological Records Centre's
Watsonian vice county layers (GPL 3.0,
https://github.com/BiologicalRecordsCentre/vice-counties) and from Irish vice
county boundaries by OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL,
https://github.com/SK53/Irish-Vice-Counties); it remains under those licences.
data/places.json contains GeoNames data (CC BY 4.0).

Text, figures, the paper and the collage are released under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).
